# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "Opt-in personal profiles, shown in context only, with every line the member's own to share or hide."
msgstr "Perfiles personales opcionales, mostrados solo en contexto, con cada línea en manos del miembro para compartir u ocultar."

# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "It says what a module may do, what it must never touch, and how a village switches it on and off."
msgstr "Dice qué puede hacer un módulo, qué no debe tocar nunca, y cómo una aldea lo enciende y lo apaga."

# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "START_HERE"
msgstr "START_HERE"

# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "Paste the guide into your agent"
msgstr "Pegue la guía en su agente"

# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "Read the contract"
msgstr "Lea el contrato"

# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "Once it lands, your module appears on this page in every village, off until a village chooses it."
msgstr "Una vez integrado, su módulo aparece en esta página en cada aldea, apagado hasta que una aldea lo elija."

# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "Run the module facts"
msgstr "Ejecute los datos del módulo"

# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "The repository"
msgstr "El repositorio"

# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "Open the pull request"
msgstr "Abra el pull request"

# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "One command prints every check the pull request will face, read from the workflows themselves."
msgstr "Un comando imprime cada verificación que enfrentará el pull request, leída de los propios flujos de trabajo."

# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "Get listed"
msgstr "Aparezca en la lista"

# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "The Module Library contract"
msgstr "El contrato de la Biblioteca de módulos"

# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "An outside service keeps what an organisation knows, and the module syncs it in with a review step for people."
msgstr "Un servicio externo guarda lo que sabe una organización, y el módulo lo sincroniza con un paso de revisión para las personas."

# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "Give START_HERE to the AI you build with. It walks you both through the repository and the first files to write."
msgstr "Dé START_HERE a la IA con la que construye. Les guía a ambos por el repositorio y los primeros archivos que escribir."

# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "Send it to the upstream repository. A person reads every module before it ships."
msgstr "Envíelo al repositorio principal. Una persona lee cada módulo antes de publicarlo."

# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "A shared ritual: live sessions"
msgstr "Un ritual compartido: sesiones en vivo"

# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "A personal practice: Gene Keys"
msgstr "Una práctica personal: Gene Keys"

# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "Templates for gatherings, with drop-ins like a shared breath or a bell, run together in real time."
msgstr "Plantillas para encuentros, con momentos como una respiración compartida o una campana, vividos juntos en tiempo real."

# needs-native-review: role card rows and the module builder's steps, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "module builder journey"
msgid "A connected tool: organisational memory"
msgstr "Una herramienta conectada: memoria organizacional"
